    'on': '2026-11-18'
    said: 'sitting 1, Q1: as proposed: the driver contract is the kept interface, ruled changed for Rust (it ships
      sloppy-cases); the Python API alike, made-for rust; sitting 2: split: changed about the program''s name only;
      kept for the driver contract'
  - is: changed
    to: a program sloppy-cases with the same request and lines
    about: the program's name
    made-for: N:target/rust
    by: R:maker/transconceiver
